      "name": "Superconducting-device experiments and quasiparticle mitigation",
      "url": "https://sadmanahmedshanto.com/projects/1_project/",
      "description": "Designed, fabricated, packaged, and measured superconducting resonators and qubit-scale devices; developed a 15 nm nanobridge-SQUID fabrication process that increased functional-device yield from under 2% to over 90%; built hidden-Markov-model inference for quasiparticle occupation; and pursued Andreev-bound-state spectroscopy and quasiparticle traps.",
